<div class="dataLine"><span class="dataLabel">Adresse:</span> <span id="phAddr">-</span></div>
<div class="dataLine"><span class="dataLabel">SOL:</span> <span id="phSol">-</span></div>
<div class="dataLine"><span class="dataLabel">USDC:</span> <span id="phUsdc">-</span></div>
</div>

<!-- 2. Wallet POWCHAIN -->
<div class="card">
<h2>2. Wallet POWCHAIN</h2>
<h3>2.1 Créer / générer</h3>
<div class="row">
<button id="btnCreateSrv">Créer un wallet POWCHAIN (serveur)</button>
<button id="btnGenLocal">Générer un wallet POWCHAIN (local)</button>
</div>
<div class="dataLine"><span class="dataLabel">Adresse POWCHAIN:</span> <span id="pwAddr">-</span></div>
<div class="dataLine"><span class="dataLabel">Clé privée locale:</span> <span id="pwPriv">-</span></div>

<h3>2.2 Recharger / balances</h3>
<div class="row">
<input id="inpAddrLoad" placeholder="Adresse POWCHAIN à charger"/>
<button id="btnLoadWallet">Recharger le wallet (balances)</button>
</div>
<div class="dataLine">
<span class="dataLabel">POW:</span> <span id="pwPow">-</span> • 
<span class="dataLabel">USDC:</span> <span id="pwUsdc">-</span> • 
<span class="dataLabel">Staked:</span> <span id="pwStk">-</span> • 
<span class="dataLabel">Nonce:</span> <span id="pwNonce">-</span>
</div>
</div>

<!-- 3. Bridge SOL → POWCHAIN -->
<div class="card">
<h2>3. Bridge SOL → POWCHAIN</h2>
<div class="dataLine"><span class="dataLabel">Adresse trésorerie Solana:</span> <span class="badge">BZJsWeJizv3YeyuWjF5187jrcduPFAHWjqL7jgq4kGwy</span></div>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#ddd;margin-top:6px">
Envoie du SOL avec Phantom vers la trésorerie, puis crédit en POW sur ton wallet POWCHAIN (hors scope automatique dans cette version, info affichée + log).
</p>
<button id="btnBridgeInfo">Bridge SOL vers POWCHAIN (infos)</button>
